Backport to the 26.2.4-based fork: the prerequisites of MR 41981
(8b03ae787f4 loop-exit reconvergence, f11071ce865 multiview docs) are
already in 26.2.4. The conflicts in docs/features.txt,
docs/relnotes/new_features.txt and src/panfrost/ci/panfrost-g52-fails.txt
were resolved by keeping the fork's files; the driver hunk applied as is.

